    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0013_700a701e5397.png\"/><br/>$\\lambda_1=4 \\ell$<br/>$\\mathrm{f}_1=\\frac{\\mathrm{v}}{4 \\ell}$<img src=\"assets\\st0013_08b76e731e1d.png\"/><br/>$\\begin{aligned} & \\lambda_2=\\frac{16 \\ell}{5} \\\\ & \\mathrm{f}_2=\\frac{5 \\mathrm{~V}}{16 \\ell} \\\\ & \\frac{\\Delta \\mathrm{f}}{\\mathrm{f}}=\\frac{\\frac{\\mathrm{V}}{\\ell}\\left(\\frac{1}{16}\\right)}{\\frac{\\mathrm{V}}{4 \\ell}} \\times 100=25 \\%\\end{aligned}$"
